                                                                          │ 2 items are marked: 1 item safe to rebuild 1 item delicate: data a tool owns,    │  
                                                                          │ which may hold something that is not reproducible The preview names each one's   │  
                                                                          │ command or path before anything runs.                                            │  
                                                                          │ Development caches looks at the caches, downloads, build directories, dependency │  
                                                                          │ trees and container stores of the development tools this machine actually has -- │  
                                                                          │ a tool is named only when a program on the PATH, an environment variable or an   │  
                                                                          │ existing directory says it is used here. Every finding starts unmarked, and the  │  
                                                                          │ dependencies, the container images and the volumes are never marked for you: a   │  
                                                                          │ store is looked at, and then cleaned, only because you marked it and confirmed   │  
                                                                          │ the preview. Nothing runs on its own.                                            │  
                                                                          │ The scan looks at the stores the tools keep in their own locations and at the    │  
                                                                          │ project directories listed here. It never walks a whole disk, and it never       │  
                                                                          │ follows a symbolic link out of a store it knows. No project directory has been   │  
                                                                          │ added, so the build artifacts and dependency trees inside projects are not part  │  
                                                                          │ of this scan. [d] Add the project directory /home/testuser/projects adds         │  
                                                                          │ /home/testuser/projects, the directory this installer was started from.          │  
